---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import biopic from "../assets/tamra.png";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<Layout
  title="About | Silver Coast Fitness"
  description="Meet Tamra Ancona, PTA — over 30 years helping people move with confidence, now leading friendly movement classes for older adults in Santa Cruz County."
>
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mx-auto">
      <div class="grid place-content-center">
        <Image
          src={biopic}
          alt="Tamra Ancona"
          width={640}
          class="w-60 h-60 md:w-80 md:h-80 rounded-full mx-auto md:mt-20"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="grid place-content-center">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mt-2 mb-4 md:mt-16 text-text-dark">
          Tamra Ancona, PTA
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-left text-text-medium max-w-prose mb-4">
          I’m a Physical Therapist Assistant with over 30 years of experience,
          including 15 years working in home health care. I am certified in
          Basic Life Support (BLS) and Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation (CPR).
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-left text-text-medium max-w-prose mb-4">
          In my years as a home health PTA, I’d watch people make great
          progress, and then the visits would end. Without someone to keep them
          going, many found it hard to stay active on their own. I founded
          Silver Coast Fitness to offer friendly, approachable classes and a
          little encouragement to keep moving and keep enjoying the things they
          love.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-left text-text-medium max-w-prose mb-4">
          Silver Coast Fitness was founded in 2023, and its classes focus on
          walking, gentle strength and balance exercises, and building an
          active routine.
        </p>
        {/* TODO: add a sentence on Tamra's Santa Cruz connection. */}
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-left text-text-dark max-w-prose">
          Silver Coast Fitness provides movement classes and general fitness
          guidance—not physical therapy, rehabilitation, or medical care.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/tamra-ancona-06456065"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 min-h-11 mt-4 font-semibold text-brand-secondary underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-brand-secondaryDark"
        >
          <Icon name="linkedin" class="w-6 h-6" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" />
          Connect with Tamra on LinkedIn
          <span class="sr-only">(opens in a new tab)</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
